# A short grating does not radiate everything: 1 - exp(-leakage x length).
# Reference: closed form.
title Uniform grating 10 um long
grating angle=10 length=10
leak 0.14
expect radiated 0.75340304 1e-06
expect overlap 0.87017860 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.32779760 2e-05
expect position 4.16793509 0.005
expect radiated 0.75340304 1e-6
